7	/**
8	 * Derives an owner's {@code memberId} — the owner's single unified identity, formatted
9	 * {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>} (e.g. {@code NSW261A2B3C4D7}):
10	 *
11	 * <ul>
12	 * <li>{@code REGION} is the region code derived from the postcode: look the postcode up
13	 * against the inclusive region ranges (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099) and,
14	 * only when the postcode is absent or in no known range, fall back to the fixed
